  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前から思ってたけど
&lt;Hisui&gt;のゴーグルって
かっこいいよなぁ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, I've always thought your goggles look super cool!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アトミナ社のゴーグルか。
いい品を使ってるわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those are made by Atomina, right? You've got good taste.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だろぉ〜♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know, right~! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺のゴーグル、いいだろ♪
・１５００ガルドもしたんだ
・それなりの品を身につけないとな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My goggles are pretty sweet, right? ♪
・I got 'em for 1500 Gald
・Gotta have a cool accessory</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>旅に出て、すぐに買ったんだ。
１５００ガルドもしたんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Since I was headin' out on a journey, I snatched these up as soon as I saw 'em. I got 'em for 1500 Gald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;には無駄遣い！　って
超〜怒られたけど、やっぱ
俺って本物志向だからな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt; had a go at me for "wastin' money" so I copped an earful, but these things are the real deal! So worth it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>１５００ガルド!?
このモデルの相場は
確か７００ガルドくらいよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>1500 Gald?! Isn't the going price for that model only 700?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えッ!?　けど露店のオヤジは
３０００ガルドの品を
１５００にまけとくって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What?! But the dude at the stall was sayin' he dropped it down from 3000...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だまされたのね、見事に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You were scammed, honey.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴーグルはかっこいいけど
&lt;Hisui&gt;はかっこ悪いよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The goggles may be cool, but the wearer sure is lame...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お兄ちゃん……無駄遣い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;... you wasted your money...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>露店のオヤジめぇッ！
今度会ったら撃ち殺す……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn that old fart! Next time I see 'em, he's gettin' a free arrow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱ、男は
それなりの品を
身につけないとな♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, a man's gotta have a cool accessory right? ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいなぁ、アトミナのゴーグル……
よし、オレも買おう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aw man, they're so cool... I'm getting a pair too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マネすんじゃねぇよ！
てめぇなんか
鼻メガネで十分だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Get your own thing! Some groucho glasses is good enough for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>十分な訳ないだろッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's THAT supposed to mean?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……この野郎……
鼻メガネがいらねぇくらい
鼻をはらしてやるぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Why you little... I'mma break that damn nose of yours so you CAN'T wear glasses!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>23912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ……やっぱり男は
身につけている物より
……中身よね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh dear... you boys shouldn't fuss about what you wear... it's what's inside that counts, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
